

Programa pamamahala-ng-memorya: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Totoo.
>> a := Listahan ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Bagay bago.
c kapag: ['greet:'] gawin: { Labas isulat: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Programa linisin.
>> usedMemory1 := (Programa memorya ? 0).




